OL,3,ADavid Bowie's Scottish links celebrated
OL,4,Ain new exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs musician Nile Rodgers once noted,
OL,7,FDavid Bowie did not just make art - he
OL,8,Fwas art.
OL,10,FSo it is apt that his life and work
OL,11,Fshould be celebrated in the V&A Dundee,
OL,12,Fwithin earshot of the first venue he
OL,13,Fplayed in Scotland under his new stage
OL,14,Fname.
OL,16,FDavid Bowie and the Buzz were not even
OL,17,Fthe headline act that night at the
OL,18,FPalais de Dans in 1966, but it was the
OL,19,Fstart of a relationship with Scottish
OL,20,Ffans which continues today.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
